{"ancestors": "0,9021399,9021400", "bizKey": "9021401", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2023-11-17 16:54:39", "detail": "<p>题材基本面介绍：</p><p><br></p><p>环氧塑封料是封装芯片的关键材料，其中70%以上为填充料。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/11/17/26193abf-0448-4fc3-8ee4-bd5a0a06ff99-1700212456833.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 384.98px;height: 207.07px;\"/></p><p>目前常见的环氧塑封料的主要组成为填充料（70％～90％）、环氧树脂（18％以下）、固化剂（9％以下）、添加剂（3％~7%左右）。</p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/11/17/a0b2a175-e64a-4128-ad3f-331990af3f31-1700212496160.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 387.99px;height: 302.17px;\"/></p><p>从下游环氧塑封料生产企业成本角度来看，以华海为例，<span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57);\"><strong>其中环氧树脂成本第一、硅微粉第二、酚醛树脂排名第三</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57);\">。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://guduoduo-app.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/upload/rich/2023/11/17/ae6c0fa4-26ea-439c-88bb-3a662d46cbd2-1700212549376.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"width: 387.99px;height: 294.34px;\"/></p>", "firstLetter": "HYSFL", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "环氧塑封料", "parentId": 9021400, "pctChg": 3.06, "reason": "环氧塑封料是封装芯片的关键材料", "remark": "", "sort": -100, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9021401, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2023-11-21 14:58:36"}
